WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:07.491
To build it yourself, tap New flow, then "🧩 Build it myself".

2
00:00:07.621 --> 00:00:10.030
Start from "Simple welcome only".

3
00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:11.966
Write your welcome.

4
00:00:12.096 --> 00:00:15.652
{name} becomes their first name.

5
00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:17.903
Then add a "👆 Tap Start" button.

6
00:00:18.203 --> 00:00:19.839
One rule to know.

7
00:00:19.969 --> 00:00:24.213
Telegram gives your bot 5 minutes to greet people who ask to join.

8
00:00:24.343 --> 00:00:27.776
Once they tap Start, you can message them anytime.

9
00:00:28.077 --> 00:00:29.857
Add the next message.

10
00:00:29.987 --> 00:00:31.543
When should it come?

11
00:00:31.673 --> 00:00:33.016
"⚡ Right away".

12
00:00:33.315 --> 00:00:35.788
Type: "Please tap the button above 👆".

13
00:00:36.089 --> 00:00:39.762
Next, pick "👆 When they tap Start", and offer your VIP.

14
00:00:41.586 --> 00:00:47.627
Give it two buttons: a "🔗 Link" to your VIP group, and a "💬 Reply" button they can tap, "🤔 Tell me more".

15
00:00:51.515 --> 00:00:56.612
Add a reminder for anyone who hasn't tapped: "💤 If they don't respond in 10 minutes".

16
00:00:57.858 --> 00:01:01.206
Then pick "🔘 When they tap a button", and choose "🤔 Tell me more".

17
00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:08.486
"👁 Preview this step" shows just that message.

18
00:01:09.564 --> 00:01:13.088
"▶ Preview the whole flow" plays it like a new member sees it.

19
00:01:13.218 --> 00:01:15.265
Tap Start, then a button.

20
00:01:20.408 --> 00:01:22.924
Then tap "📲 Send a test to my Telegram".

21
00:01:23.054 --> 00:01:24.834
Nothing is counted.

22
00:01:30.045 --> 00:01:31.414
Looks good.

23
00:01:31.544 --> 00:01:33.607
Save it, and switch it on.

24
00:01:33.737 --> 00:01:37.064
Your bot now welcomes everyone who asks to join.
